      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DESPICABLE KYRO (3) boasts a strong record this journey here with five wins and six minors from 12 tries. In the money last time at this track (25.37) in a Grade 5, finishing a 7 length second. Looks well placed and should feature. LAKOTA COURTNEY (1) settled down midfield and held her position to the line when finishing 5th (22.53) at Gosford. Goes well out of this box with a win and four minor placings. Has the ability to give this a shake. TORNADO ETHICS (4) had a tricky draw and ran well to finish second, beaten 1.5 lengths, (22.42) at this track. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Must be included in calculations. TROPICAL ETHICS (7) profiles nicely here at this trip.",
